            "text": "<p>Tess got her first dog, a collie, at twenty two and made every mistake in this book. Then she helped at a local puppy class, started her own and spent nine years answering the same questions every Saturday.</p><p>She now writes a short letter about training every other week. This is sample text. Replace it with your own story.</p>"
